And yeah, it was an amazing way to extend

00:48:17.720 --> 00:48:22.720
that life and yeah, it was a lot of fun.
Tim Ferriss: Okay. So let's come back to Maui

00:48:22.720 --> 00:48:31.690
Nui. And there are a whole different number
of angles that I want to take to cover some

