02:04:25.940 --> 02:04:28.599
an adventure.
Jake Muise: Well, can't tell you how much

02:04:28.599 --> 02:04:33.820
we've appreciated the support and insight
and advice. It's been highly impactful as

02:04:33.820 --> 02:04:37.429
well.
Tim Ferriss: Yeah. What a gift it's been to

02:04:37.429 --> 02:04:45.099
get to know you and to realize, like you said,
well, I mean, your family's very down-to-earth,

02:04:45.099 --> 02:04:53.360
but connected with the Earth in a way that
is very aspirational for me. I really think

02:04:53.360 --> 02:05:01.150
very fondly, I still have photos on my phone,
