02:05:11.770 --> 02:05:14.400
Jake Muise: It is when you're out there.
Tim Ferriss: It really makes a difference

02:05:14.400 --> 02:05:18.880
when you get up at five in the morning and
it's just fucking — you've been freezing

02:05:18.880 --> 02:05:22.110
your nuts off, which surprise, surprise, can
